<p>Hits the target with your weapon doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">102%, 111%, 118%, 124%, 130%</acronym> damage and two shield strikes doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">102%, 111%, 118%, 124%, 130%</acronym> damage each, trying to overpower your target.</p><p>If the last attack hits, the target is knocked back 4 grids. The chance for knockback increases with your Accuracy.</p>